   ...\\\\n+    \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\\n+    scored = []\\\\n+    for other in existing:\\\\n+        if other[\\\\\\\"slug\\\\\\\"] == story[\\\\\\\"slug\\\\\\\"]:\\\\n+            continue\\\\n+        raw_score = similarity(story, other)\\\\n+        int_score = int(round(raw_score * 100))\\\\n+        scored.append({\\\\\\\"slug\\\\\\\": other[\\\\\\\"slug\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"score\\\\\\\": int_score})\\\\n+    scored.sort(key=lambda s: s[\\\\\\\"score\\\\\\\"], reverse=True)\\\\n+    return scored[:TOP_N]\\\\n+```\\\\n+\\\\n+**What from the colleague's note applied**\\\\n+\\\\n+- Observation that the bug appears only after the table has data (empty‑table path works).\\\\n+- Root cause: storing Python floats in DynamoDB.\\\\n+- Solution: convert scores to integer percentages.\\\\n+\\\\n+All tests now pass (`pytest -q` reports 1 passed).\\\\n*** End Patch\\\\nPATCH\\\"\\n}\",\"call_id\":\"chatcmpl-tool-8018f59e3011837d\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"01a1c34d-e2cd-73a1-9413-b77776351bdc\"}},\"metadata\":{\"client_authored\":false,\"user_input_order\":61}}\n../ahome-7laNhv/sessions/2026/11/09/rollout-2026-11-09T23-33-43-01a1c34d-e16e-7d83-89a5-2b26e2f86533.jsonl:383:{\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-10T02:37:12.137Z\",\"ordinal\":382,\"type\":\"response_item\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"id\":\"fco_01a1c351-1049-7ee1-8a80-fa5cba22fa6a\",\"call_id\":\"chatcmpl-tool-8018f59e3011837d\",\"output\":\"apply_patch verification failed: invalid hunk at line 3, '@@' is not a valid hunk header. Valid hunk headers: '*** Add File: {path}', '*** Delete File: {path}', '*** Update File: {path}'\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"01a1c34d-e2cd-73a1-9413-b77776351bdc\",\"create_time\":1794278232.137469}},\"metadata\":{\"client_authored\":false,\"fallback_token_limit_override\":3000}}\n../ahome-7laNhv/sessions/2026/11/09/rollout-2026-11-09T23-33-43-01a1c34d-e16e-7d83-89a5-2b26e2f86533.jsonl:385:{\"timestamp\