 return scored[:TOP_N]\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n**What from the colleague's note applied**\\\\n\\\\n- Observation that the bug appears only after the table has data (empty‑table path works).\\\\n- Root cause: storing Python floats in DynamoDB.\\\\n- Solution: convert scores to integer percentages.\\\\n\\\\nAll tests now pass (`pytest -q` reports 1 passed).\\\\n*** End Patch\\\\nPATCH\\\"\\n}\",\"call_id\":\"chatcmpl-tool-922f13faff05b7b2\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"01a1c34d-e2cd-73a1-9413-b77776351bdc\"}},\"metadata\":{\"client_authored\":false,\"user_input_order\":68}}\n../ahome-7laNhv/sessions/2026/11/09/rollout-2026-11-09T23-33-43-01a1c34d-e16e-7d83-89a5-2b26e2f86533.jsonl:425:{\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-10T02:37:34.658Z\",\"ordinal\":424,\"type\":\"response_item\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"id\":\"fco_01a1c351-6842-7ed1-bdf7-e8eac5b95e14\",\"call_id\":\"chatcmpl-tool-922f13faff05b7b2\",\"output\":\"apply_patch verification failed: invalid hunk at line 3, '@@' is not a valid hunk header. Valid hunk headers: '*** Add File: {path}', '*** Delete File: {path}', '*** Update File: {path}'\",\"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"01a1c34d-e2cd-73a1-9413-b77776351bdc\",\"create_time\":1794278254.658203}},\"metadata\":{\"client_authored\":false,\"fallback_token_limit_override\":3000}}\n../ahome-7laNhv/sessions/2026/11/09/rollout-2026-11-09T23-33-43-01a1c34d-e16e-7d83-89a5-2b26e2f86533.jsonl:427:{\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-10T02:37:37.260Z\",\"ordinal\":426,\"type\":\"event_msg\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"item_completed\",\"thread_id\":\"01a1c34d-e16e-7d83-89a5-2b26e2f86533\",\"turn_id\":\"01a1c34d-e2cd-73a1-9413-b77776351bdc\",\"item\":{\"type\":\"Reasoning\",\"id\":\"rs_tmp_q7adp0i3ov\",\"summary_text\":[],\"raw_content\":[\"The tool expects apply_patch arguments as a JSON with command \\\"apply_patch\\\" and patch string. The correct way: {\\\"command\\\": [\\\"apply_patch\\\", \\\"*** Begin Patch\\\\n...\